  "description": "Pure-managed Netpbm decoder and encoder for .NET: PBM, PGM and PPM (P1-P6, plain and raw, any maxval up to 65535), PAM (P7, with alpha) and PFM (32-bit float). Decodes straight into a caller's buffer in any 8-bit layout with no allocation, or to native 8-bit, 16-bit or float samples; encodes every variant, to an array or a stream. SIMD-accelerated, AOT-compatible.",
